Theorem depot_put_spec : ltac2:(zQ "i70!h9!hgc!l9!hf!kt4!hv2!js0!vd!hvb!kta!j6!le!m3!ig9!js6!ku2!hi9!kuc!ju4!hq1!kv6!lk3!ii9!ll1!llc!lm4!lmb!hqa!ln2!kj8!kne!ks3!io9!ip9!iu6!jj0!jna!lo5!ksa>2ra@1$1@1$0#k0>2sp@1$1@1$0#k0>2gp@1$1@1$0#k0>2tp@1$1@1$0#k0>2t0@1$1@1$0#k0>2t1@1$1@1$0#k0>2t2@1$1@1$0#k0>2s0@1$1@1$0#k0>2s1@1$1@1$0#k0>2a2@1$1@1$0#k0>2a3@1$1@1$0#k0>2a4@1$1@1$0#k0>2a5@1$1@1$0#k0>2a6@1$1@1$0#k0>2a7@1$1@1$0#k0>2s2@1$1@1$0#k0>2s3@1$1@1$0#k0>2s4@1$1@1$0#k0>2s5@1$1@1$0#k0>2s6@1$1@1$0#k0>2s7@1$1@1$0#k0>2s8@1$1@1$0#k0>2s9@1$1@1$0#k0>3s10@1$1@1$0#k0>3s11@1$1@1$0#k0>2t3@1$1@1$0#k0>2t4@1$1@1$0#k0>2t5@1$1@1$0#k0>2t6@1$1@1$0#k0>1F@2$h3@1$0#5@1$1@1$0#k0>2fc@1$1@1$0#i0>2lo$3>2TR$3>1T@1$9$3>4rest@1$9@1$1@1$0#k0>1d$hb>1m>0@1$1@1$0#k0@1$h0@1$1@1$0#8=1n$3@1$i5@2$f$3^4>0@2$a@2$2+1^1@2$2^1+ve>0@3$h1$3\1x$3@2$a@2$2Z^1@2$b^1@2$c+2+k0^6>0@2$2@2$4^9+u0@2$8@1$0#k0^i7>0@2$2$h4^a>0@2$2@2$8@1$0#k0^i9^a>0@2$2@2$4^b@2$7+8^6@2$c+2+k0>0@2$b@2$4@1$h8^9+1+hggg0>0@2$2@2$4@2$4@1$h7^a^8+1+ogg0>0@2$2@2$4@1$h9^b@2$7+h0+hggg0^f>0@2$2@2$4@1$ha^c@2$7+8+ogg0^h0>0@3$h6$5^d^c>0@4$he$5^d^h1@3$e@1$1@1$0#k0@4$h2$3@1$1@1$0#k0$6^h0^f>0@4$i1$5^e^h3@2$8@1$0#k0^j1>0@2$i3$5^f@3$hf$5@h7$hd^j4^j3^j2^j1^id^ic^i5^i4^i3^i2^i1^i0^hf^he^hd^hc^h7^h6^h5^h1@1$h5^h3^f^h0@7$i2@hf$i0^j4^j3^j2^j1^j0^if^ie^id^ic@1$6^h4@1$6^f^ib^ia^i9^i8^i7^i6^i5^i4^i3^i2^i1^i0^hf^he^hd^hc^hb^ha^h9^h8^h7@2$i6@1$0#k0$hc^h6@1$d@1$1@1$0#k0^h0@1$i4$5").
Proof.
  intros until m. intros n NR RNG LO IMGLO TR1 TR2 C1 C2 B1 B2 DEPO BUF ST MI. unfold STACK_DEPOT_PUT, wz.
  step. step. zstep. step. step. step. step. step.
